						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>46173650</arrivalTick>
						<text>Ethan has reappeared.

He looks withered by the inhuman thought-patterns of the void. All traces of humanity have left his eyes.

Ethan's mind and body are now permanently linked to the dark void of inhuman rage. Powered by this new connection, Ethan no longer feels tethered to mortal needs like comfort or sleep. He has gained the ability to induce terror in others using the power of the void.

The monolith is awakened. It hums louder with Ethan's reappearance, a reminder that its connection to the void has been opened and made permanent.</text>
