					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>Acolyte &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Nikmos Meli&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Imperium&lt;/color&gt; is requesting that you build a monument to commemorate his imperials who have fallen in battle.

The monument is 9 x 11 in size and will require these resources (total value $386):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x280
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x196
    - Granite blocks x196
    - Limestone blocks x196
    - Slate blocks x196
    - Marble blocks x196
    - Vacstone blocks x196

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;13 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task. You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.

If the monument is destroyed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;15 days&lt;/color&gt; days of construction, your relations with &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Imperium&lt;/color&gt; will fall by -10.</description>
					<root>BuildMonument_Basic</root>
