					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rurik Redtail&lt;/color&gt;, Divine Templar of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Coalition of Funbo&lt;/color&gt; is requesting a favor. His friend, a 23-year-old machine collector named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Kenny&lt;/color&gt;, recently violated an ancient supercomputer terminal. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rurik&lt;/color&gt; is asking for you to guard &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Kenny&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;17 days&lt;/color&gt;.

(*Threat)Two mech clusters(/Threat) of 2x size will deploy nearby.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Kenny&lt;/color&gt; is sick with blood rot and will require daily treatment. The disease can be slowed with high-quality care and medicine, but generally cannot be cured outright. If the disease becomes severe, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Kenny&lt;/color&gt; will die, so ensure you have the necessary medical supplies.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Kenny&lt;/color&gt; appreciates quality accommodation. You will gain goodwill with &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Coalition of Funbo&lt;/color&gt; if you keep his average mood above 50%.

4 elite mercenaries will be placed under your control. You will have to feed and house them, but they may die in battle without consequence.</description>
