					<description>A 9-year-old child named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Dale&lt;/color&gt; is calling from nearby. He admits he profaned a peace ritual between &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Miasma Faction&lt;/color&gt; and &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Wttwyttra Fur&lt;/color&gt;. Now they are both chasing him!

