					<description>A machine persona in an orbiting ship wants to perform some planetary experiments. However, if she carries out her experiment, a psychic suppression wave will reduce the consciousness of all males around &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Red Grove&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;5.3 days&lt;/color&gt;.

She is concerned about getting in trouble with the ethical review board, and is asking for your consent.</description>
