					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rurik&lt;/color&gt;, Divine Templar of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Coalition of Funbo&lt;/color&gt;, has discovered an ancient complex a long distance away. He believes it contains information about the relic known as &lt;color=#436394FF&gt;Kira's Voice&lt;/color&gt;.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rurik&lt;/color&gt; can't spare people to look into it, but hopes you can help by supplying exactly 4 colonists to carry out the investigation.

The complex contains unknown threats and is also being sought by &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rurik&lt;/color&gt;'s enemies, &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Wttwyttra Fur&lt;/color&gt;.

He will send a shuttle to pick up your colonists, bring them to the complex, and take them home afterward. They will be fed and tended to en-route.

Once you have landed, you must hack all terminals in the complex within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;4 days&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
