				<li>
					<id>186</id>
					<name>Solberg's Smoke Spewer</name>
					<appearanceTick>23110000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceExpireTick>23214300</acceptanceExpireTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>23214300</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>2</challengeRating>
					<description>A 11-year-old child named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Sigvard Solberg&lt;/color&gt; is calling from nearby. He is hiding from his enemies. He wants to flee his hiding spot and join you at &lt;color=#D9D9BFFF&gt;the The Exodus Imperium distress signal&lt;/color&gt;.

If you accept him, his enemies will set up a site nearby to harass you. There's &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;a smoke spewer machine&lt;/color&gt; there belching smoke over the whole region and there may be an &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;unknown threat&lt;/color&gt;.

The threat will remain until you go to destroy it.</description>
					<root>ThreatReward_SiteThreat_Joiner</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<charity>True</charity>
					<parent>null</parent>
				</li>
