					<name>Mysterious Cargo</name>
					<appearanceTick>23179000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceExpireTick>23299000</acceptanceExpireTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>23299000</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>Divine Templar &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rurik Redtail&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;Coalition of Funbo&lt;/color&gt; has an odd request. He would like you to accept some unspecified cargo. When pressed for more details, he avoids the question. There is desperation in his voice.

If you accept, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rurik Redtail&lt;/color&gt; will deliver the mystery cargo by transport pod.</description>
