					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>Your orbital scanner has detected the location of an abandoned orbital platform. You don't detect any signs of life.

You can break in to obtain the loot inside, but the platform probably has defense systems.

You can travel to orbital locations using gravships, shuttles, or transport pods.</description>
