					<acceptanceTick>23342248</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<endOutcome>Fail</endOutcome>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>25142248</cleanupTick>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>2</challengeRating>
					<description>While talking with the trader (*Name)Dennis(/Name), (*Name)Anarchist(/Name) learned of the location of an infamous company of mercenaries. These ancient soldiers are from a long-forgotten era in the planet's history. They have recently awoken from cryptosleep and are causing trouble in the area.

The company is led by &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Skissor&lt;/color&gt;, who possesses a unique &lt;color=#ffeb04&gt;legendary&lt;/color&gt; weapon. The group contains:

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 ancient captain&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;2 ancient soldiers&lt;/color&gt;

If you're able to capture or kill the leader, you can take the unique weapon.

The soldiers are hiding out in an ancient structure at Irgu Fen.</description>
					<root>OpportunitySite_AncientMercenaries</root>
					<signalsReceivedDebug IsNull="True" />
					<parts />
					<tags />
					<parent>null</parent>
