					<appearanceTick>23355000</appearanceTick>
					<acceptanceTick>23355000</acceptanceTick>
					<acceptedBy>null</acceptedBy>
					<ended>True</ended>
					<cleanedUp>True</cleanedUp>
					<cleanupTick>24806461</cleanupTick>
					<initiallyAccepted>True</initiallyAccepted>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>A prisoner being held by &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Asgo Union&lt;/color&gt; has managed to steal a radio and call you!

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Jackboot&lt;/color&gt; is being held at a camp near &lt;color=#C70246FF&gt;the destroyed settlement&lt;/color&gt; under armed guard. Rescue him, and he will join your colony. He is a 43-year-old cave explorer. He says that there's an enemy outpost at the site guarded by &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;15 tribespeople&lt;/color&gt; and there may be an &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;unknown threat&lt;/color&gt;.

If you miss this opportunity, you may never hear from &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Jackboot&lt;/color&gt; again.</description>
