					<cleanupTick>24432332</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>Baron &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Euphemia Erecusli&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Imperium&lt;/color&gt; is requesting that you build a monument to express how burning she is.

The monument is 14 x 26 in size and will require these resources (total value $1602):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x680
  - Any of: Stony x125
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x1088
    - Granite blocks x1088
    - Limestone blocks x1088
    - Slate blocks x1088
    - Marble blocks x1088
    - Vacstone blocks x1088

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;35 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task. You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.

If the monument is destroyed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;15 days&lt;/color&gt; days of construction, your relations with &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Imperium&lt;/color&gt; will fall by -10.</description>
