It could be a great opportunity to improve relations with their faction and receive gifts, but beware - a poor negotiator can cause more harm than good and may even anger them.

Other factions will respect you more if you send your leader to handle the negotiations. Veilfather &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Mike 'Anarchist' Xuan&lt;/color&gt; will get a bonus to the chance of a successful outcome.

Successful peace talks can earn your negotiator a small amount of personal honor with &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;The Exodus Imperium&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
