					<cleanupTick>25217984</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>9 desperate refugees are approaching. Their leader is called &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rawersh&lt;/color&gt;. They claim to have lost their home in a recent attack. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rawersh&lt;/color&gt; begs you for permission to stay at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Red Grove&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;18 days&lt;/color&gt; so they can rest and regroup.

In return, they offer to work and fight for free during that time.

If you make them happy, some of them may offer to join you. They may also reward you later for helping them - but there is no way to know their true intentions.

