					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Rurik&lt;/color&gt;, Divine Templar of &lt;color=#00FF00FF&gt;Coalition of Funbo&lt;/color&gt;, is making a request. A mechanoid swarm has been attacking his settlements. He wants you to signal the mechs to distract them while he clears the hive. If you do, (*Threat)a mechanoid cluster(/Threat) will land at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Red Grove&lt;/color&gt;.

