					<cleanupTick>26592887</cleanupTick>
					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>A shuttle of &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Imperium&lt;/color&gt; has taken damage and is seeking a place to land. Its commander &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Maria&lt;/color&gt; wants to land at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Red Grove&lt;/color&gt;.

Pigskins from &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Polpmol-Squ League&lt;/color&gt; will attack the crashed shuttle site in an attempt to kill its occupants. You must defend them.

The shuttle contains &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Maria&lt;/color&gt;, 2 other civilians, and 2 troopers. The commander and civilians must be rescued, but the troopers may be sacrificed.

After &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;8 hours&lt;/color&gt;, a rescue shuttle will come to pick up the survivors. You'll need to get them all on board within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;12 hours&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
