					<challengeRating>2</challengeRating>
					<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Lucas 'Blackjack' Wakefield&lt;/color&gt;, Holy Bishop of &lt;color=#00FF00FF&gt;Exo Emporium&lt;/color&gt;, recently rescued 2 guild members from the prisons of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Wttwyttra Fur&lt;/color&gt;. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Blackjack&lt;/color&gt; wants you to guard them at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Red Grove&lt;/color&gt; for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;21 hours&lt;/color&gt; until he can send a shuttle to collect them. The guild members know secrets about the moral transgressions of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Wttwyttra Fur&lt;/color&gt;, so they will be hunted.

There will be (*Threat)2 raids(/Threat) of roughly this size:

  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 boss&lt;/color&gt;
  - &lt;color=#D46F68FF&gt;1 drifter&lt;/color&gt;
