					<description>While talking with the trader (*Name)Jennifer(/Name), (*Name)Vector(/Name) learned of the location of an infamous company of mercenaries. These ancient soldiers are from a long-forgotten era in the planet's history. They have recently awoken from cryptosleep and are causing trouble in the area.

