					<challengeRating>1</challengeRating>
					<description>Great Chief &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Retzrath Jeov&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#FF3333FF&gt;Sulasz&lt;/color&gt; is requesting that you build a monument to spread images of her throne across the land.

The monument is 20 x 33 in size and will require these resources (total value $3799):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x1280
  - Any of: Stony x1250
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x1904
    - Granite blocks x1904
    - Limestone blocks x1904
    - Slate blocks x1904
    - Marble blocks x1904
    - Vacstone blocks x1904

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;39 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task.

After completion, you'll have to protect the monument for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;24 days&lt;/color&gt;. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Jeov&lt;/color&gt; will be upset if you abandon it during this time. If any piece of it is destroyed, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Jeov&lt;/color&gt;'s enforcement system will activate and a weather-control system will force the weather around &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Red Grove&lt;/color&gt; to be a blind fog for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;8.9 days&lt;/color&gt;.

You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.</description>
