								<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
								<text>At the center of the orbital platform sits a massive mechanoid structure made of hair-fine ultratech filaments supporting an AI persona core. This is the intelligence core of the mechhive that directs mechanoids all over the planet.

The structure is protected by nearby stabilizers, making it nearly invulnerable. Find and destroy the cerebrex stabilizers to lower the core's defenses.</text>
