					<description>Novice &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Placus Tropasan&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#00FF00FF&gt;The Exodus Imperium&lt;/color&gt; is requesting that you build a monument to insult the bravery of his rival.

The monument is 32 x 15 in size and will require these resources (total value $2726):

  - Any of: Metallic, woody, stony x1182
  - Any of: Stony x500
  - Any of:
    - Sandstone blocks x1544
    - Granite blocks x1544
    - Limestone blocks x1544
    - Slate blocks x1544
    - Marble blocks x1544
    - Vacstone blocks x1544

Construction must be completed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;36 days&lt;/color&gt; of accepting the task. You'll receive the rewards when you finish construction.

If the monument is destroyed within &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;15 days&lt;/color&gt; days of construction, your relations with &lt;color=#00FF00FF&gt;The Exodus Imperium&lt;/color&gt; will fall by -10.</description>
