					<description>Your orbital scanner has detected the location of an asteroid orbiting the planet. It contains significant amounts of gold ore, and potentially other resources as well.

Orbital miners steer asteroids into orbit so that they can be mined and the ore sold to orbital traders. You do not detect any signs of life from this asteroid.

You can reach the asteroid with transport pods, shuttles, or a gravship. Equip your colonists with sufficient orbital apparel before departing.</description>
