					<challengeRating>-1</challengeRating>
					<description>High Stellarch &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Appa Diogenes&lt;/color&gt; of &lt;color=#00FF00FF&gt;The Exodus Imperium&lt;/color&gt; has sent us a message. A fugitive named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tank&lt;/color&gt; escaped from her custody and used a transport pod to flee to an abandoned orbital platform. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tank&lt;/color&gt; was in custody for grand larceny and multiple counts of corporate sabotage.

Having heard rumors of your gravship, the High Stellarch asks that you travel to the abandoned platform and kill &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tank&lt;/color&gt;. If you do so, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Appa&lt;/color&gt; will reward you with a gravtech device.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Appa&lt;/color&gt; warns you that &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tank&lt;/color&gt; may be in the company of hostile orbital pirates.</description>
