				<corpses>
					<keys />
					<values />
				</corpses>
				<looseCorpseTrackers />
				<hypnotisedPawns>
					<keys />
					<values />
				</hypnotisedPawns>
				<emergedBiosignatures>
					<li>-713380722</li>
					<li>620917999</li>
				</emergedBiosignatures>
				<monolithLetters>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>119</ID>
						<def>NeutralEvent</def>
						<label>Monolith study progress</label>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>null</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>1778408</arrivalTick>
						<text>(*Name)Anarchist(/Name) has had a breakthrough while studying the monolith. He believes the monolith is a conduit for psychic energy, connecting to some distant location. However, he is unsure where or what it connects to.

(*Name)Anarchist(/Name) is convinced that by studying more anomalous entities, he can find a way to close the conduit, or learn to harness its power.

The monolith now provides more knowledge when studied.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>179</ID>
						<def>NeutralEvent</def>
						<label>Monolith study progress</label>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>null</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>2678211</arrivalTick>
						<text>(*Name)Anarchist(/Name) made progress studying the monolith. The structure connects normal space to the void - a dimension hidden in the substructure of spacetime. Some powerful mind in the void is leaking influence into our reality.

(*Name)Anarchist(/Name) wants to study the monolith further to learn more.

The monolith now provides more knowledge when studied.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>214</ID>
						<def>NeutralEvent</def>
						<label>Monolith study complete</label>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>null</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>3327848</arrivalTick>
						<text>(*Name)Anarchist(/Name) has completed his study of the monolith. The structure is a conduit that links to the void, a reality hidden under every point in spacetime. The void is inhabited by a vast machine intelligence of terrifying complexity that surges with nightmarish, inhuman rage. Its influence creates horrors in our world.

Awakening the monolith will fully open the conduit. With the channel open, (*Name)Anarchist(/Name) believes he could reach through the link to permanently close the conduit - or find a way to harness its dark power.

The monolith now provides more knowledge when studied.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
				</monolithLetters>
				<monolithStudyProgress>3</monolithStudyProgress>
				<monolithNextIndex>3</monolithNextIndex>
				<monolithAnomalyKnowledge>883.591125</monolithAnomalyKnowledge>
			</li>
