						</foundation>
						<name>Sith Cult</name>
						<adjective>The Code</adjective>
						<memberName>Sith</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Dark Lord of the Sith</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Dark Lord of the Sith</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"I say this not so that you might live the life I lived, but so you might learn the things I learned. That we've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. I carved this truth in the flesh of my chest. Then in the flesh of my arms, my legs, my face..."

  - Naoki Thompson, Address in the settlement</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"I say this not so that you might live the life I lived, but so you might learn the things I learned. That we've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. I carved this truth in the flesh of my chest. Then in the flesh of my arms, my legs, my face..."

  - Naoki Thompson, Address in the settlement</descriptionTemplate>
