						<name>Children of Mandalore</name>
						<adjective>mandalorian</adjective>
						<memberName>Mandalorian</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Chieftan</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Chieftan</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"It was incredibly tough to grow up in that place, and not all of us made it. Even so, those who perished in the struggle made clear that the true nature of humans is to live in small, nomadic communities. That's why we're proud to express the strength of our hearts using the heels of our boots."

  - Hiroshi Adkins, just before execution</description>
