						<name>Republic</name>
						<adjective>republican</adjective>
						<memberName>Citizen</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Prime President for Life</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Prime President for Life</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"Through you I want to speak to our people, to the authentic, real, great people, who fight with the courage of lions on land, sea and air fronts. It is so important you understand that In these days our generations are not merely faced with territorial and political problems, but also with supreme issues of the existence of our faith, our civilization and our culture, which are now at stake once more. That's why we're proud to express the strength of our hearts using the heels of our boots."

  - John Boogers, on a fiery Address on the forest</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"Through you I want to speak to our people, to the authentic, real, great people, who fight with the courage of lions on land, sea and air fronts. It is so important you understand that In these days our generations are not merely faced with territorial and political problems, but also with supreme issues of the existence of our faith, our civilization and our culture, which are now at stake once more. That's why we're proud to express the strength of our hearts using the heels of our boots."

  - John Boogers, on a fiery Address on the forest</descriptionTemplate>
