						<description>"To: All Employees

From: Upper Management

Subject: Inappropriate use of time on Google Doodle games

Regarding employee incentives, please remember that this is not a charity. As the saying goes: "It is wealth that moves the world, and profit that rules it". Please be sure to follow this new procedure. It is prioritary that we start thinking outside the box. And let's all sing from the same hymn sheet."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"To: All Employees

From: Upper Management

Subject: Inappropriate use of time on Google Doodle games

