						<name>Dark Side Elite</name>
						<adjective>dark</adjective>
						<memberName>Dark sider</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Dark Lord</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Dark Lord</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Hidden to the prying eyes of scientists and philosophers, an occult world of hidden knowledge awaits. Only a select few have the mental strength to acquire such insights. Such occult knowledge won't be acquired without violence. Only by showing true strength can we hope to unlock the secrets of the Cosmos.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Hidden to the prying eyes of scientists and philosophers, an occult world of hidden knowledge awaits. Only a select few have the mental strength to acquire such insights. Such occult knowledge won't be acquired without violence. Only by showing true strength can we hope to unlock the secrets of the Cosmos.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>guy762_culture_sith</culture>
						<iconDef>StarsC</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Teal</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.941, 0.000, 0.000, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>VME_Structure_Esotericism</li>
