					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Yttak</place>
							<deities />
						</foundation>
						<name>Egalitarianism</name>
						<adjective>egalitarian</adjective>
						<memberName>Egalitarian</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Ethical Mind</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Ethical Mind</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Oppressed by distant rulers who demanded uniform obedience from the people, Greg 'Barby' Barabanow created a rebel movement that smashed the state and built a new land of liberty in its place. Barby's followers studied his writings and created a social structure that has always brought stability to us all. Barby's ideas of tolerance and equality deeply resonated with some people, and a new school of thought was born: Light knows no bigotry, wind knows no discrimination, rain knows no snobbery, crops know no segregation.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Oppressed by distant rulers who demanded uniform obedience from the people, Greg 'Barby' Barabanow created a rebel movement that smashed the state and built a new land of liberty in its place. Barby's followers studied his writings and created a social structure that has always brought stability to us all. Barby's ideas of tolerance and equality deeply resonated with some people, and a new school of thought was born: Light knows no bigotry, wind knows no discrimination, rain knows no snobbery, crops know no segregation.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>guy762_culture_coreworlds</culture>
						<iconDef>guy762_IdeoIcon_oldrepublic</iconDef>
