						<description>"They were amazed at our uniformness of thought. I explained to them that there is nothing more important than a harmony of purpose and thought; no indecision, no doubts; the security and strength of an unified will. The pose begins when you want to leave it."

  - Ryo 'Maverick' Conley, on his mindfulness dissertation</description>
