					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Rogia</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>The Cosmos</name>
									<type>Boundless Infinity</type>
									<gender>Male</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>VME_Gestalt</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>Rogian Collective</name>
						<adjective>pantheistic</adjective>
						<memberName>Pantheist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Meditating Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Meditating Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The Universe, in the sense of the totality of all existence, and God are identical. Divinity is all around us, forming &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;The Cosmos&lt;/color&gt;. If we want to truly understand the nature of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;The Cosmos&lt;/color&gt; we must engage in quiet and respectful contemplation of everything on it. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;The Cosmos&lt;/color&gt; said to all, "The only frontier that has ever existed is the self. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;The Cosmos&lt;/color&gt; has spoken."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The Universe, in the sense of the totality of all existence, and God are identical. Divinity is all around us, forming %%deity0_name%%. If we want to truly understand the nature of %%deity0_name%% we must engage in quiet and respectful contemplation of everything on it. %%Deity0_name%% said to all, "The only frontier that has ever existed is the self. %%Deity0_name%% has spoken."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>guy762_culture_outerrim</culture>
						<iconDef>CirclesC</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkOlive</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.490, 0.196, 0.196, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>VME_Structure_Pantheism</li>
							<li>VME_Gestalt</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Interment of Total Unity</name>
								<def>Funeral</def>
								<ID>2460</ID>
								<randomSeed>-60505798</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFuneral</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<ritualExpectedDesc>You can hold a {IDEOLIGION_adjective} funeral for {PAWN_nameDef}.</ritualExpectedDesc>
								<ritualExpectedDescNoAdjective>You can hold a funeral for {PAWN_nameDef}.</ritualExpectedDescNoAdjective>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>FuneralStandard</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_GraveWithTarget">
									<def>GraveWithTargetsCorpse</def>
									<parent>Precept_2460</parent>
								</obligationTargetFilter>
								<targetFilter IsNull="True" />
