						<leaderTitleMale>Big Boss</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Big Boss</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>From humble and unremarkable origins, Gerard Perreault, our first Kajidii, raised above his station, imposing his unwavering will. One day while walking the streets, Perreault was surrounded by filthy beggars. He beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Perreault instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside.</description>
