The exterior of this book is finely bound and the pages are pristine.</descriptionFlavor>
									<joyFactor>1</joyFactor>
									<description>&lt;color=#E6E64CFF&gt;Amelia's Intro to Pugilism&lt;/color&gt; (&lt;color=#FFEB04&gt;legendary&lt;/color&gt;)

A standardized book on pugilism. The précis focuses on the more skilled aspects of the subject.

According to the back cover, Amelia Bucks was known for being a master of many subjects. The synopsis says that, though these notes were made for Amelia's personal use, they have been widely shared.

The exterior of this book is finely bound and the pages are pristine.

 - Melee: 500 XP / hour (max level 16)</description>
