									<title>Rusty's Exploration</title>
									<descriptionFlavor>This book provides interesting facts about flavors. The précis says that, when Rusty wrote this, it was the cutting edge in the field.

According to the synopsis, Russell 'Rusty' Shackleford spent his days teaching in the academy on Zeglar. This book is taken from his lectures. The useful parts of this book are hidden among the biographical details.

Though the cover is very plain, the pages are bright and clean.</descriptionFlavor>
