													<StanceID>Form I: Shii-Cho</StanceID>
													<MinSeverity>0.100000001</MinSeverity>
													<StanceIconPath>UI/Icons/Gizmo/Stance_Form1</StanceIconPath>
													<StanceString>Form I: Shii-Cho  Users: Kit Fisto  

 Shii-Cho, the Way of the Sarlacc, is the most basic form focusing on wide, sweeping strikes and disarming techniques, ideal for beginners seeking simplicity and versatility in combat.</StanceString>
													<ShortLabel>Shii-Cho</ShortLabel>
													<Angle>45</Angle>
													<AttackSpeed>1.10000002</AttackSpeed>
													<ParryChance>0.899999976</ParryChance>
													<StrongAgainst>
														<li>Form VI: Niman</li>
