													<MinSeverity>3</MinSeverity>
													<StanceIconPath>UI/Icons/Gizmo/Stance_Form3</StanceIconPath>
													<StanceString>Form III: Soresu  Users: Obi-Wan Kenobi  

 Soresu, the Way of the Mynock, is a defensive form focused on tight, efficient movements and quick reflexes, designed to provide maximum protection against blaster fire and lightsaber attacks.</StanceString>
													<ShortLabel>Soresu</ShortLabel>
													<Angle>75</Angle>
													<AttackSpeed>0.800000012</AttackSpeed>
													<ParryChance>1.5</ParryChance>
