													<StanceString>Form IV: Ataru  Users: Yoda  

 Ataru, the Way of the Hawk-Bat, is an acrobatic and aggressive style characterized by its fast-paced, energetic movements, incorporating flips and spins to overwhelm opponents with speed and unpredictability</StanceString>
													<ShortLabel>Ataru</ShortLabel>
													<AttackSpeed>1.39999998</AttackSpeed>
													<ParryChance>0.699999988</ParryChance>
