													<MinSeverity>6</MinSeverity>
													<StanceIconPath>UI/Icons/Gizmo/Stance_Form6</StanceIconPath>
													<StanceString>Form VI: Niman  Users: Darth Maul  

 Niman, the Way of the Rancor, is a balanced form incorporating elements of all previous forms, providing practitioners with versatility and adaptability in combat situations, making it a preferred choice for diplomats and peacekeepers.</StanceString>
													<ShortLabel>Niman</ShortLabel>
													<Offset>(-0.200000003, -0.100000001, 0.300000012)</Offset>
