													<StanceString>Form VII: Juyo/Vaapad  Users: Mace Windu   

 Juyo and its variant Vaapad, the Ferocity and the Way of the Vornskr respectively, are aggressive and unpredictable styles that channel the user's inner darkness, offering immense offensive power at the risk of succumbing to the dark side of the Force.</StanceString>
